# KeyQuest Governance

- Work Issue-first. Link meaningful changes to GitHub Issues.
- Keep `docs/MILESTONES.md` and `docs/TODO.md` aligned with active work.
- Keep `main` releasable; run `npm run verify` before pushing.
- Prefer small PRs with clear acceptance criteria and test plans.
- Preserve terminal portability across Linux, macOS, and Windows.
- Favor practice effectiveness over decorative game mechanics.
